# Licencje / Licenses

This repository mixes two licenses: one for the **dataset** (not distributed here,
downloaded from Hugging Face) and one for the **code** in this repository.

---

## 1. Dataset — AFO (Aerial dataset of Floating Objects)

**Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0)**

Copyright (c) 2021 Jan Gąsienica-Józkowy, Mateusz Knapik, Bogusław Cyganek,
and the photographers credited in the README.

The AFO images and annotations are licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0:
<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/>

You are free to **share** and **adapt** the material under these terms:

- **Attribution** — cite the paper (see CITATION.cff / README) and indicate changes.
- **NonCommercial** — you may not use the material for commercial purposes.
- **ShareAlike** — derivatives must be distributed under the same license.

**This applies to models trained on AFO.** Weights derived from AFO inherit the
non-commercial restriction; the checkpoints published alongside this repository
are for research use only.

No dataset files are stored in this repository. They are downloaded at runtime from
<https://huggingface.co/datasets/jgasienica/afo-dataset>.

